    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga sarmani bea gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gageanu Dawdi sea fuga hees was shirikara ak ghwasach fuga mwaatkwa aba jeeda orjooga Asafu, ea gea Hemani ea gea Yedutuni, jea gwarukuta giijasta aba sarmeeda nea gwasarmaniida gureayeeka ea ginaanda ea gidoondooriida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea orjooga Asafu; Sakuri ea Yosefu, ea Netaniya, ea Asherela, Rukusa, Asafu, ghayi ramoaran aba ng'asheanda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gea Yedutuni, orjooga Yedutuni, Gedaliya, ea Seri, ea Yeshaya ea Shimeyi ea Hashabiya, ea Matitiya, buuneeda ea lah, ghayi rukusa ghweanda nyaawa was Yedutuni mideawa gidoondooriida, ghayi sarman nea gabadiischeesa nea ghoaghaambiit NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gea Hanani: Bukiya gil, ea Matamiya, ea Usieli. Ea Shebueli, ea Yeremoti, ea Hananiya, ea Hanani, ea Eliata, ea Gidalti, ea Romanti-eseri, ea Yoshbekasha, ea Maloti, ea Hotiri, ea Mahasiyoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu seaniin orjooga Hemani, was siida deaha ng'asheega bea sugoocheanda, aba ng'asheanda ASEETA, ak geataw hawunda. Ak ghoadaw ASEETA Hemani orju damanang'wan ea hawi samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu seaniin gwarukusa ghweanda nyaawa gideaba asarmana aba gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gaba gureayeeka, ea ginandajeega, ea gidoondoorajeega, aba gadiyeeda gheeda ASEETA; nea Asafu, ea Yedutuni, ea Hemani, ak gwasin gidarukusa sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak mooneeda nyaawa sea buweadeega nyaawa ghayi siinaal gichea gwasarmasiinda NG'UTAMIIDA, was hirgheata sean, ea bughalaji iyeenya ea seedam ea sis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gealoat gadiyoojiga nyaawa, gea manang'i ea gea hees, giinealshoodiga ea diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak loota madeeda Yosefu bea Asafu, deabiyeenya Gedaliya; niny sea orjooga ghaamwat, ea diibigaaschi, atamaniyeenya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba samwagu Sakuri, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, damaniyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba ang'wan Seri, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea damaniyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba muut Netaniya, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea damaniyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba lah Bukiya, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea damaniyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba ispwa Asharela, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea damaniyeenya ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba sis Yeshaya, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea damaniyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deaba shageash Mataniya, ea diibigaaschi ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea damaniyeenya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
